{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.54, "text": "In this town, there's a monster that can only move in the dark."}, {"start": 4.02, "end": 8.22, "text": "And if the lights go out for even one second, it's over for all of us."}, {"start": 8.92, "end": 12.1, "text": "Three years ago, this thing appeared in the middle of our town."}, {"start": 12.58, "end": 14.78, "text": "That night, seven people disappeared."}, {"start": 15.22, "end": 17.64, "text": "But when the sun came up, the monster froze."}, {"start": 18.24, "end": 20.9, "text": "That's when we discovered its weakness, light."}, {"start": 21.48, "end": 24.46, "text": "So the government built six massive floodlights around it."}, {"start": 24.72, "end": 26.6, "text": "Each one has its own backup generator."}, {"start": 26.6, "end": 30.78, "text": "And every night, 12 guards watch over it with powerful flashlights."}, {"start": 31.32, "end": 36.02, "text": "For three years, the monster hasn't moved an inch until last night."}, {"start": 36.66, "end": 40.34, "text": "My dad is the head of security, and he finally let me join his night shift."}, {"start": 40.86, "end": 44.24, "text": "Everything seemed normal until 2.13 a.m."}, {"start": 44.78, "end": 47.0, "text": "Boom! One of the floodlights exploded!"}, {"start": 47.5, "end": 48.54, "text": "But dad wasn't worried."}, {"start": 49.3, "end": 50.64, "text": "Relax, we've still got five."}, {"start": 51.22, "end": 52.74, "text": "Then his radio crackled."}, {"start": 53.2, "end": 55.18, "text": "Chief, the main power cable is damaged."}, {"start": 55.18, "end": 56.94, "text": "We need to shut down the system."}, {"start": 57.42, "end": 58.62, "text": "What about the backup generators?"}, {"start": 59.08, "end": 60.84, "text": "Sir, they're overheating!"}, {"start": 61.34, "end": 62.82, "text": "Dad immediately grabbed his radio."}, {"start": 63.64, "end": 64.84, "text": "Everyone, emergency positions!"}, {"start": 65.46, "end": 67.96, "text": "Within minutes, police cars surrounded the square."}, {"start": 68.36, "end": 70.02, "text": "Their headlights pointed at the monster."}, {"start": 70.68, "end": 71.86, "text": "Guards raised their flashlights."}, {"start": 72.2, "end": 75.04, "text": "Even people in nearby buildings aimed lamps out their windows."}, {"start": 75.56, "end": 76.52, "text": "Then, click!"}, {"start": 77.06, "end": 78.8, "text": "The entire town went dark."}, {"start": 79.3, "end": 80.48, "text": "Except for the monster."}, {"start": 81.02, "end": 84.32, "text": "Hundreds of lights were still shining on it, and it couldn't move."}, {"start": 84.32, "end": 85.96, "text": "I thought we were safe."}, {"start": 86.64, "end": 90.14, "text": "Until thunder crashed, and heavy rain started pouring down."}, {"start": 90.48, "end": 92.44, "text": "One guard slipped, dropping his flashlight."}, {"start": 92.9, "end": 94.76, "text": "Then, a police car's headlights died."}, {"start": 95.22, "end": 96.28, "text": "Keep the lights on it!"}, {"start": 96.44, "end": 97.02, "text": "Dad screamed."}, {"start": 97.48, "end": 99.66, "text": "I rushed to help, but I tripped over a cable."}, {"start": 100.02, "end": 103.04, "text": "My flashlight flew out of my hand, and for one second,"}, {"start": 103.38, "end": 105.52, "text": "the monster was completely in the dark."}, {"start": 105.8, "end": 108.46, "text": "A terrifying scream echoed through the square."}, {"start": 108.88, "end": 112.52, "text": "Everyone immediately aimed their lights back at it, and the monster froze."}, {"start": 112.52, "end": 115.08, "text": "But it wasn't in the middle of the square anymore."}, {"start": 115.52, "end": 119.32, "text": "It was standing right in front of us, and in its enormous hand,"}, {"start": 119.64, "end": 121.96, "text": "was one of the guards, still alive."}, {"start": 122.64, "end": 122.84, "text": "Dad!"}, {"start": 123.16, "end": 124.16, "text": "We have to save him!"}, {"start": 124.48, "end": 125.66, "text": "But Dad grabbed my arm."}, {"start": 126.0, "end": 126.42, "text": "Don't move!"}, {"start": 126.94, "end": 127.2, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 127.66, "end": 128.72, "text": "He pointed at the monster."}, {"start": 129.12, "end": 131.76, "text": "Because if those lights go out again, he's dead."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.18}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.18, "e": 0.38}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.38, "e": 0.72}, {"w": "there's", "s": 1.06, "e": 1.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.36}, {"w": "monster", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.76}, {"w": "that", "s": 1.76, "e": 1.98}, {"w": "can", "s": 1.98, "e": 2.12}, {"w": "only", "s": 2.12, "e": 2.54}, {"w": "move", "s": 2.54, "e": 2.82}, {"w": "in", "s": 2.82, "e": 3.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 3.1, "e": 3.22}, {"w": "dark.", "s": 3.22, "e": 3.54}, {"w": "And", "s": 4.02, "e": 4.1}, {"w": "if", "s": 4.1, "e": 4.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.18, "e": 4.34}, {"w": "lights", "s": 4.34, "e": 4.52}, {"w": "go", "s": 4.52, "e": 4.76}, {"w": "out", "s": 4.76, "e": 4.96}, {"w": "for", "s": 4.96, "e": 5.12}, {"w": "even", "s": 5.12, "e": 5.4}, {"w": "one", "s": 5.4, "e": 5.78}, {"w": "second,", "s": 5.78, "e": 6.2}, {"w": "it's", "s": 6.7, "e": 7.04}, {"w": "over", "s": 7.04, "e": 7.36}, {"w": "for", "s": 7.36, "e": 7.56}, {"w": "all", "s": 7.56, "e": 7.8}, {"w": "of", "s": 7.8, "e": 7.94}, {"w": "us.", "s": 7.94, "e": 8.22}, {"w": "Three", "s": 8.92, "e": 9.08}, {"w": "years", "s": 9.08, "e": 9.32}, {"w": "ago,", "s": 9.32, "e": 9.62}, {"w": "this", "s": 9.88, "e": 10.1}, {"w": "thing", "s": 10.1, "e": 10.5}, {"w": "appeared", "s": 10.5, "e": 10.98}, {"w": "in", "s": 10.98, "e": 11.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.16, "e": 11.28}, {"w": "middle", "s": 11.28, "e": 11.42}, {"w": "of", "s": 11.42, "e": 11.64}, {"w": "our", "s": 11.64, "e": 11.76}, {"w": "town.", "s": 11.76, "e": 12.1}, {"w": "That", "s": 12.58, "e": 12.76}, {"w": "night,", "s": 12.76, "e": 13.04}, {"w": "seven", "s": 13.56, "e": 13.74}, {"w": "people", "s": 13.74, "e": 14.18}, {"w": "disappeared.", "s": 